    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. A backpack is positioned on the bottom side of the image. Above the backpack is a keyboard, and above the keyboard is a bowl. A stapler is located to the right of the bowl. Additionally, for every remote in the scene, there is a spoon to its right, and that remote is positioned above the stapler.",
